#: views/dahdi_mfcr2_settings.php:175
msgid ""
"Brazil uses a special calling party category for collect calls (llamadas por "
"cobrar)<br />instead of using the operator (as in Mexico). The R2 spec in "
"Brazil says a special GB tone should be used to reject collect calls. If you "
"want to ALLOW collect calls specify 'yes', if you want to BLOCK collect "
"calls then say 'no'. Default is to block collect calls. <br />(see also "
"'mfcr2_double_answer')<br /> <strong>Default:</strong>no"
msgstr ""
"巴西使用特殊的發話方類別來處理對方付費通話（llamadas por cobrar）<br />而非採用接線生（如墨西哥的做法）。巴西的 R2 規範指出，應使用特殊的 GB 音來拒絕對方付費通話。如果您想允許對方付費通話，請指定「yes」；如果您想封鎖對方付費通話，請指定「no」。預設為封鎖對方付費通話。<br />（另請參閱「mfcr2_double_answer」）<br /> <strong>預設：</strong>否"

#: views/dahdi_mfcr2_settings.php:265
msgid ""
"Brazil uses a special signal to force the release of the line (hangup) from "
"the backward perspective. <br />When mfcr2_forced_release=no, the normal "
"clear back signal will be sent on hangup, which is OK for most mfcr2 "
"variants except for the Brazilian variant where the central will leave the "
"line up for several seconds (30, 60). <br /> This is sometimes is not what "
"people really want. When mfcr2_forced_release=yes, a different ; signal will "
"be sent to hangup the call indicating that the line should be released "
"immediately.<br /> <strong>Default:</strong>no"
msgstr ""
"巴西使用特殊訊號，從後向端強制釋放線路（掛斷）。<br />當 mfcr2_forced_release=no 時，掛斷時會送出一般的 clear back 訊號，這對大多數 mfcr2 變體都沒問題，但巴西變體除外——在該變體中，交換機會讓線路持續數秒（30、60）。<br /> 有時這並非人們真正想要的。當 mfcr2_forced_release=yes 時，會送出不同的 ; 訊號來掛斷通話，表示線路應立即釋放。<br /> <strong>預設：</strong>否"

