#: views/dahdi_global_settings.php:172
msgid ""
"In some cases, the echo canceller doesn't train quickly enough and there is "
"echo at the beginning of the call.  Enabling echo training will cause DAHDI "
"to briefly mute the channel, send an impulse, and use the impulse response "
"to pre-train the echo canceller so it can start out with a much closer idea "
"of the actual echo.  Value may be \"yes\", \"no\", or a number of "
"milliseconds to delay before training (default = 400)"
msgstr ""
"在某些情況下，回音消除器訓練得不夠快，通話一開始就會有回音。啟用回音訓練會讓 DAHDI 暫時將通道靜音、送出一段脈衝，並利用脈衝響應預先訓練回音消除器，讓它一開始就能更接近實際的回音。值可以是 \"yes\"、\"no\"，或是在訓練前延遲的毫秒數（預設 = 400）"

