#: views/dahdi_analog_settings.php:19
msgid ""
"Kewl Start - Coined term for an extension of loop start (FXO and FXS) "
"signaling which adds disconnect supervision through the use of an open "
"switching interval (OSI). In addition to the operation afforded by loop "
"start, the CO (central office) signals the terminal (user) end that the "
"distant party has hung up. The CO switch will remove battery voltage from "
"the loop for about 250 ms, within 6 seconds after the far-end party "
"disconnects."
msgstr ""
"Kewl Start - 這是延伸自迴路啟動（FXO 與 FXS）訊號的自創術語，透過使用開路切換間隔（OSI）加入斷線監督。除了迴路啟動原有的運作方式外，市話交換機（CO）會向終端（使用者）端發出訊號，表示遠端已掛斷。遠端掛斷後 6 秒內，CO 交換機會將迴路中的電池電壓移除約 250 ms。"

