#: views/dahdi_mfcr2_settings.php:101
msgid ""
"Logging is stored at the Asterisk logging directory specified in asterisk."
"conf plus mfcr2/<whatever you put here>. If you specify 'span1' here and "
"asterisk.conf has as logging directory /var/log/asterisk then the full path "
"to your MFC/R2 call logs will be /var/log/asterisk/mfcr2/span1 (the "
"directory will be automatically created if not present already)"
msgstr ""
"記錄會存放在 asterisk.conf 中指定的 Asterisk 記錄目錄加上 mfcr2/<您在此填入的內容>。若您在此指定「span1」，而 asterisk.conf 的記錄目錄為 /var/log/asterisk，則 MFC/R2 通話記錄的完整路徑會是 /var/log/asterisk/mfcr2/span1（若目錄不存在，會自動建立）"

#: views/dahdi_analog_settings.php:28
#: views/dahdi_analog_signalling_form.php:14
msgid "Loop Start"
msgstr "迴路啟動"

#: views/dahdi_analog_settings.php:20
msgid ""
"Loop Start - When idle, or on-hook, the loop potential is held a nominal 48V "
"DC, provided by the telephone exchange or a foreign exchange station (FXS) "
"interface. When a terminal initiates use the line, it causes current to flow "
"by closing the loop, and this signals the FXS end to provide dial tone on "
"the line and to expect dial signals, in form of DTMF digits or dial pulses, "
"or a hook flash. When the loop is opened and current stops flowing, the "
"subscriber equipment signals that it has finished using the line; the "
"telephone exchange resets the line to an idle state."
msgstr ""
"迴路啟動 - 閒置或掛機時，迴路電位維持在標稱 48V DC，由電話交換機或外線交換站（FXS）介面提供。當終端開始使用線路時，會閉合迴路使電流通過，這會通知 FXS 端在線路上提供撥號音，並預期收到撥號訊號（DTMF 數字、撥號脈衝或掛鉤閃斷）。當迴路斷開、電流停止流動時，使用者設備即表示已使用完線路；電話交換機會將線路重設為閒置狀態。"

