msgstr "MFC/R2"

#: page.dahdi.php:317
#: views/dahdi_mfcr2_settings.php:1
msgid "MFC/R2 Settings"
msgstr "MFC/R2 設定"

#: views/dahdi_mfcr2_settings.php:7
msgid "MFC/R2 Variant"
msgstr "MFC/R2 變體"

#: views/dahdi_mfcr2_settings.php:133
msgid ""
"MFC/R2 valid logging values are: all, error, warning, debug, notice, cas, "
"mf, stack, nothing<br />error,warning,debug and notice are self-descriptive. "
"<br />'cas' is for logging ABCD CAS tx and rx<br />'mf' is for logging of "
"the Multi Frequency tones<br /> 'stack' is for very verbose output of the "
"channel and context call stack, only useful if you are debugging a crash or "
"want to learn how the library works. The stack logging will be only enabled "
"if the openr2 library was compiled with -DOR2_TRACE_STACKS. <br /> You can "
"mix up values, like: <strong>`loglevel=error,debug,mf`</strong> to log just "
"error, debug and multi frequency messages<br /> 'all' is a special value to "
"log all the activity <br /> 'nothing' is a clean-up value, in case you want "
"to not log any activity for a channel or group of channels <br /> BE AWARE "
"that the level of output logged will ALSO depend on the value you have in "
"logger.conf, if you disable output in logger.conf then it does not matter "
"you specify 'all' here, nothing will be logged so logger.conf has the last "
"word on what is going to be logged"
msgstr ""
"MFC/R2 可用的記錄值為：all、error、warning、debug、notice、cas、mf、stack、nothing<br />error、warning、debug 與 notice 顧名思義。<br />「cas」用於記錄 ABCD CAS 的傳送與接收<br />「mf」用於記錄多頻音<br /> 「stack」用於非常詳細地輸出通道與 context 呼叫堆疊，只有在對當機進行除錯或想了解此程式庫運作方式時才有用。只有在 openr2 程式庫以 -DOR2_TRACE_STACKS 編譯時，才會啟用堆疊記錄。<br /> 您可以混合多個值，例如：<strong>`loglevel=error,debug,mf`</strong>，只記錄 error、debug 與多頻訊息<br /> 「all」是記錄所有活動的特殊值<br /> 「nothing」是清理用的值，用於不想記錄某個通道或某群通道的任何活動時<br /> 請注意，記錄的輸出層級也會取決於您在 logger.conf 中的設定；若您在 logger.conf 中停用輸出，那麼在此指定「all」也沒有用，不會記錄任何內容，因此 logger.conf 對於要記錄什麼有最終決定權"

#: views/dahdi_mfcr2_settings.php:147
msgid ""
"MFC/R2 value in milliseconds for the MF timeout. <br />Any negative value "
"means 'default', smaller values than 500ms are not recommended and can cause "
"malfunctioning. <br />If you experience protocol error due to MF timeout try "
"incrementing this value in 500ms steps<br /> <strong>Default:</strong>-1"
msgstr ""
"MFC/R2 的 MF 逾時值，單位為毫秒。<br />任何負值都代表「預設」；不建議使用小於 500ms 的值，可能導致運作異常。<br />如果您因 MF 逾時而遇到協定錯誤，請嘗試以 500ms 為單位增加此值<br /> <strong>預設：</strong>-1"

#: views/dahdi_mfcr2_settings.php:9
msgid ""
"MFC/R2 variant, this depends on the OpenR2 supported variants. A list of "
"values can be found by executing the openr2 command `r2test -l`"
msgstr "MFC/R2 變體，這取決於 OpenR2 所支援的變體。可執行 openr2 命令 `r2test -l` 取得可用值清單"

