#: views/dahdi_mfcr2_settings.php:159
msgid "Metering Pulse Time Out"
msgstr "計量脈衝逾時"

#: views/dahdi_mfcr2_settings.php:161
msgid ""
"Metering pulses are sent by some telcos for some R2 variants during a call "
"presumably for billing purposes to indicate costs, however this pulses use "
"the same signal that is used to indicate call hangup. <br />Therefore a "
"timeout is sometimes required to distinguish between a <strong>real</strong> "
"hangup and a billing pulse that should not last more than 500ms. <br />If "
"you experience call drops some minutes after being established, try setting "
"a value of some ms here. Values greater than 500ms are not recommended. <br /"
"> BE AWARE that choosing the proper protocol mfcr2_variant parameter "
"implicitly sets a good recommended value for this timer.<br />Use this "
"parameter only when you *really* want to override the default, otherwise "
"just comment out this value or put a -1. <br /> Any negative value means "
"'default'.<br /> <strong>Default:</strong>-1"
msgstr ""
"部分電信業者會在通話期間為某些 R2 變體送出計量脈衝，推測是為了計費以表示費用，但這些脈衝所使用的訊號與表示通話掛斷的訊號相同。<br />因此有時需要一個逾時值，以區分<strong>真正的</strong>掛斷與不應持續超過 500ms 的計費脈衝。<br />如果您在通話建立幾分鐘後遇到通話中斷，請嘗試在此設定若干 ms 的值。不建議使用大於 500ms 的值。<br /> 請注意，選擇正確的協定 mfcr2_variant 參數，會隱含地為此計時器設定一個良好的建議值。<br />只有在您*真的*想覆寫預設值時才使用此參數，否則請將此值註解掉或填入 -1。<br /> 任何負值都代表「預設」。<br /> <strong>預設：</strong>-1"

