"Specify the audio compression scheme (codec) to be used for analog lines. "
"North American users should choose ulaw. All other countries, unless "
"otherwise known, should be assumed to be alaw. If no choice is specified, "
"the default is ulaw. Confirm the scheme which will be best for operation"
msgstr ""
"指定要用於類比線路的音訊壓縮方式（編解碼器）。北美的使用者應選擇 ulaw。除非已知其他情況，否則其他所有國家都應假定為 alaw。若未指定，預設為 ulaw。請確認最適合運作的壓縮方式"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:136
msgid ""
"Specify the audio compression scheme (codec) to be used for analog lines. "
"North American users should choose ulaw. All other countries, unless "
"otherwise known, should be assumed to be alaw. If no choice is specified, "
"the default is ulaw. Confirm the scheme which will be best for operation."
msgstr ""
"指定要用於類比線路的音訊壓縮方式（編解碼器）。北美的使用者應選擇 ulaw。除非已知其他情況，否則其他所有國家都應假定為 alaw。若未指定，預設為 ulaw。請確認最適合運作的壓縮方式。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:9
msgid "Specify the kernel module used by the installed analog hardware"
msgstr "指定已安裝的類比硬體所使用的核心模組"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:7
msgid "Specify the kernel module used by the installed analog hardware."
msgstr "指定已安裝的類比硬體所使用的核心模組。"

#: views/dahdi_global_settings.php:9
msgid "Specify the language"
msgstr "指定語言"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:184
#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:193
msgid ""
"Specify the type of Message Waiting Indicator detection to be done on FXO "
"ports. If no choice is specified, the default is none. The following options "
"are available"
msgstr "指定要在 FXO 連接埠上執行哪種類型的訊息等待指示（MWI）偵測。若未指定，預設為 none。可使用下列選項"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:145
msgid ""
"Specify the voltage used for ringing an analog phone. Normal will set the "
"ring voltage to 40V, and Peak will set the voltage to 89V. If no choice is "
"specified, the default is normal"
msgstr "指定用於振鈴類比電話的電壓。Normal 會將振鈴電壓設為 40V，Peak 則設為 89V。若未指定，預設為 normal"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:152
msgid ""
"Specify the voltage used for ringing an analog phone. Normal will set the "
"ring voltage to 40V, and Peak will set the voltage to 89V. If no choice is "
"specified, the default is normal."
msgstr "指定用於振鈴類比電話的電壓。Normal 會將振鈴電壓設為 40V，Peak 則設為 89V。若未指定，預設為 normal。"

#: views/dahdi_global_settings.php:184
msgid ""
"Specify whether the channel should be answered immediately or if the simple "
"switch should provide dialtone, read digits, etc"
msgstr "指定通道應立即應答，或由簡易交換功能提供撥號音、讀取數字等"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:157
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply Fast Ringer operation. Setting Fast Ringer (25Hz) "
"(commonly used in conjunction with the Low Power option) increases the "
"ringing speed to 25Hz. If no choice is specified, the default is normal"
msgstr "指定是否套用快速振鈴運作。設定快速振鈴 (25Hz)（通常與低功率選項搭配使用）會將振鈴速度提高至 25Hz。若未指定，預設為 normal"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:160
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply Fast Ringer operation. Setting Fast Ringer (25Hz) "
"(commonly used in conjunction with the Low Power option) increases the "
"ringing speed to 25Hz. If no choice is specified, the default is normal."
msgstr ""
"指定是否套用快速振鈴運作。設定快速振鈴 (25Hz)（通常與低功率選項搭配使用）會將振鈴速度提高至 25Hz。若未指定，預設為 normal。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:169
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply Low Power operation. Setting Fast Ringer to 50V "
"peak in conjunction with the Fast Ringer option increases the peak voltage "
"during Fast Ringer operation to 50V. If no choice is specified, the default "
"is normal"
msgstr ""
"指定是否套用低功率運作。將快速振鈴設為 50V 峰值並搭配快速振鈴選項，會讓快速振鈴運作期間的峰值電壓提高至 50V。若未指定，預設為 normal"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:168
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply Low Power operation. Setting Fast Ringer to 50V "
"peak in conjunction with the Fast Ringer option increases the peak voltage "
"during Fast Ringer operation to 50V. If no choice is specified, the default "
"is normal."
msgstr ""
"指定是否套用低功率運作。將快速振鈴設為 50V 峰值並搭配快速振鈴選項，會讓快速振鈴運作期間的峰值電壓提高至 50V。若未指定，預設為 normal。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:181
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply normal ring detection, or a full wave detection to "
"prevent false ring detection for lines where CallerID is sent before the "
"first ring and proceeded by a polarity reversal (as in the United Kingdom). "
"If you are experiencing trouble with detecting CallerID from analog service "
"providers, or have lines which exhibit a polarity reversal before CallerID "
"is transmitted from the provider, then select Full Wave. If no choice is "
"specified, the default is standard"
msgstr ""
"指定要套用一般振鈴偵測，或使用全波偵測，以避免在來電顯示於第一次振鈴前送出並先出現極性反轉的線路（如英國）上發生誤判振鈴。若您在偵測類比服務供應商的來電顯示時遇到問題，或線路在供應商送出來電顯示前會出現極性反轉，請選擇「全波」。若未指定，預設為 standard"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:176
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply normal ring detection, or a full wave detection to "
"prevent false ring detection for lines where CallerID is sent before the "
"first ring and proceeded by a polarity reversal (as in the United Kingdom). "
"If you are experiencing trouble with detecting CallerID from analog service "
"providers, or have lines which exhibit a polarity reversal before CallerID "
"is transmitted from the provider, then select Full Wave. If no choice is "
"specified, the default is standard."
msgstr ""
"指定要套用一般振鈴偵測，或使用全波偵測，以避免在來電顯示於第一次振鈴前送出並先出現極性反轉的線路（如英國）上發生誤判振鈴。若您在偵測類比服務供應商的來電顯示時遇到問題，或線路在供應商送出來電顯示前會出現極性反轉，請選擇「全波」。若未指定，預設為 standard。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:133
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply the opermode setting to your FXO modules only, or "
"to both FXS and FXO modules. If no choice is specified, the default is apply "
"opermode to fxo modules only"
msgstr ""
"指定要只將 opermode 設定套用至 FXO 模組，或同時套用至 FXS 與 FXO 模組。若未指定，預設為只將 opermode 套用至 FXO 模組"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:144
msgid ""
"Specify whether to apply the opermode setting to your FXO modules only, or "
"to both FXS and FXO modules. If no choice is specified, the default is apply "
"opermode to fxo modules only."
msgstr ""
"指定要只將 opermode 設定套用至 FXO 模組，或同時套用至 FXS 與 FXO 模組。若未指定，預設為只將 opermode 套用至 FXO 模組。"

