#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:230
msgid ""
"Suppression NLP - This setting causes the NLP to suppress echo reflections "
"by reducing the amplitude of their volume. Suppression may be used in "
"combination with the Echo cancellation NLP Max Suppression option. For users "
"in loud environments, Suppression NLP may be the best option. This is the "
"default setting for the Echo Cancellation NLP Type option"
msgstr ""
"抑制 NLP - 此設定會讓 NLP 藉由降低回音反射的音量振幅來抑制它們。抑制可與「回音消除 NLP 最大抑制」選項搭配使用。對於處於吵雜環境的使用者，抑制 NLP 可能是最佳選項。這是「回音消除 NLP 類型」選項的預設設定"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:212
msgid ""
"Suppression NLP - This setting causes the NLP to suppress echo reflections "
"by reducing the amplitude of their volume. Suppression may be used in "
"combination with the Echo cancellation NLP Max Suppression option. For users "
"in loud environments, Suppression NLP may be the best option. This is the "
"default setting for the Echo Cancellation NLP Type option."
msgstr ""
