"This message will re-appear everytime you load the module while it is in a "
"disabled write state so as to not cause any confusion"
msgstr "只要模組處於停用寫入的狀態，每次載入模組時都會再次顯示此訊息，以免造成混淆"

#: page.dahdi.php:170
msgid ""
"This module should never be used alongside \"dahdi_genconfig\". Using "
"\"dahdi_genconfig\" and this module at the same time can have unexpected "
"consequences."
msgstr "此模組不應與 \"dahdi_genconfig\" 同時使用。同時使用 \"dahdi_genconfig\" 與此模組可能會產生非預期的後果。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:246
msgid ""
"This option allows you to specify the threshold, in dB difference between "
"the received audio (post echo cancellation) and the transmitted audio, for "
"when the NLP will engage (VPMADT032 only). The default setting is 24 dB"
msgstr ""
"此選項可讓您指定接收音訊（回音消除後）與傳送音訊之間的 dB 差異臨界值，以決定 NLP 何時介入（僅限 VPMADT032）。預設設定為 24 dB"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:224
msgid ""
"This option allows you to specify the threshold, in dB difference between "
"the received audio (post echo cancellation) and the transmitted audio, for "
"when the NLP will engage (VPMADT032 only). The default setting is 24 dB."
msgstr ""
"此選項可讓您指定接收音訊（回音消除後）與傳送音訊之間的 dB 差異臨界值，以決定 NLP 何時介入（僅限 VPMADT032）。預設設定為 24 dB。"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:206
#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:224
msgid ""
"This option allows you to specify the type of Non Linear Processor you want "
"applied to the post echo-cancelled audio reflections received from analog "
"connections (VPMADT032 only). There are several options"
msgstr "此選項可讓您指定要套用至類比連線所收到、經回音消除後之音訊反射的非線性處理器類型（僅限 VPMADT032）。有多個選項"

#: views/dahdi_analog_settings.php:17
msgid ""
"This option allows you to specify the type signaling for this analog device."
msgstr "此選項可讓您指定此類比裝置的訊號類型。"

#: views/dahdi_modprobe_settings.php:258
msgid ""
"This option, only functional when the Echo Cancellation NLP Type option is "
"set to Suppression NLP, specifies the maximum amount of dB that the NLP "
"should attenuate the residual echo (VPMADT032 only). Lower numbers mean that "
"the NLP will provide less suppression (the residual echo will sound louder). "
"Higher numbers, especially those approaching or equaling the Echo "
"Cancellation NLP Threshold option, will nearly mute the residual echo. The "
"default setting is 24 dB"
msgstr ""
"此選項只有在「回音消除 NLP 類型」選項設為「抑制 NLP」時才有作用，用來指定 NLP 應衰減殘留回音的最大 dB 量（僅限 VPMADT032）。數值越低，表示 NLP 提供的抑制越少（殘留回音聽起來會更大聲）。數值越高，尤其是接近或等於「回音消除 NLP 臨界值」選項時，幾乎會將殘留回音靜音。預設設定為 24 dB"

#: views/dahdi_advanced_settings.php:228
msgid ""
"This option, only functional when the Echo Cancellation NLP Type option is "
"set to Suppression NLP, specifies the maximum amount of dB that the NLP "
"should attenuate the residual echo (VPMADT032 only). Lower numbers mean that "
"the NLP will provide less suppression (the residual echo will sound louder). "
"Higher numbers, especially those approaching or equaling the Echo "
"Cancellation NLP Threshold option, will nearly mute the residual echo. The "
"default setting is 24 dB."
msgstr ""
"此選項只有在「回音消除 NLP 類型」選項設為「抑制 NLP」時才有作用，用來指定 NLP 應衰減殘留回音的最大 dB 量（僅限 VPMADT032）。數值越低，表示 NLP 提供的抑制越少（殘留回音聽起來會更大聲）。數值越高，尤其是接近或等於「回音消除 NLP 臨界值」選項時，幾乎會將殘留回音靜音。預設設定為 24 dB。"

#: views/dahdi_global_settings.php:116
msgid ""
"This setting must be enabled on both ports involved, and the "
"\"facilityenable\" setting must also be enabled to allow sending the "
"transfer to the ISDN switch, since it sent in a FACILITY message"
msgstr ""
"此設定必須在相關的兩個連接埠上都啟用，而且還必須啟用 \"facilityenable\" 設定，才能將轉接送至 ISDN 交換機，因為它是以 FACILITY 訊息送出"

#: page.dahdi.php:480
msgid "This will reload the page"
msgstr "這會重新載入頁面"

#: views/dahdi_mfcr2_settings.php:283
msgid ""
"Toggles 'report accept call with charge'; whether or not report to the other "
"end 'accept call with charge'.  This setting has no effect with most telcos "
"and is usually is safe.<br />Leave the default (yes), but once in a while "
"when interconnecting with old PBXs this may be useful. <br />Concretely this "
"affects the Group B signal used to accept calls. <br />The application "
"DAHDIAcceptR2Call can also be used to decide this in the dial plan in a per-"
"call basis instead of doing it here for all calls.<br /> <strong>Default:</"
"strong>yes"
msgstr ""
"切換「回報接受通話並計費」；決定是否向另一端回報「接受通話並計費」。對大多數電信業者而言此設定沒有影響，通常是安全的。<br />保留預設值（yes），但偶爾在與舊式 PBX 互連時可能有用。<br />具體來說，這會影響用於接受通話的 Group B 訊號。<br />DAHDIAcceptR2Call 應用程式也可以在撥號計畫中依每通電話決定此事，而不必在此為所有通話設定。<br /> <strong>預設：</strong>yes"

